{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An open-world adventure RPG. Trade, hunt, fight, rob, plunder settlements and cities, descend into the dungeons of long-destroyed civilizations, level up your character, look for relics of the past, assemble a squad, join factions, don't let the disaster happen again, stop the legion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An open game map, no one holds you back and you are free to go wherever you want, though will you have enough strength to resist the enemies on your way?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865200/extras/c921977521b648eed5ef282a85085fc0.avif?t=1756361205\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When fighting with opponents, your weapon mastery is honed. Become a master of reaction, because the fight is mainly based on the agility and speed of your reflexes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865200/extras/9ceb143d1fd48d5a56439a3ef314ae74.avif?t=1756361205\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of locations and biomes for battles and searching for items and artifacts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865200/extras/bca0bb13d21efd66a727a93da660932a.avif?t=1756361205\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3865200?t=1756361205","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865200/d76c4dd39a6c9607e574af88757d72931cdd65dd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756361205","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3